11.61","+","+Starting with `v2.11.61`, Traefik is built with Go 1.27.","+","+### GODEBUG TLS Settings","+","+Go 1.27 removed the `tlsrsakex`, `tls10server` and `tls3des` `GODEBUG` settings.","+Setting them in the `GODEBUG` environment variable has no effect anymore.","+","+For the incoming connections, the RSA key exchange and 3DES cipher suites, as well as TLS 1.0 and 1.1,","+can still be enabled with the `cipherSuites` and `minVersion` fields of the [TLS options](../https/tls.md#tls-options),","+referenced in the TLS configuration of a [router](../routing/routers/index.md#tls) or of an [entrypoint](../routing/entrypoints.md#tls).","+","+For the connections to the backends, Traefik does not offer to configure the cipher suites,","+so the RSA key exchange and 3DES cipher suites are not available anymore.","+A backend supporting only these cipher suites cannot be reached.","+","+Please check out the [go documentation](https://go.dev/doc/go1.27#cryptotlspkgcryptotls) for more details.","+","+### Maximum Number of Request Header Values","+","+Go 1.27 limits the number of header values a request can carry to 500.","+","+A request exceeding this limit is rejected with a `431 Request Header Fields Too Large` response,","+for HTTP/1 and HTTP/2.","+This limit is not configurable.","+","+As the rejection happens before the routing, the rejected requests are not reported in the access logs.","+","+Please check out the [go documentation](https://go.dev/doc/go1.27#nethttppkgnethttp) for more details."],"additions":31,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"go.mod","lines":["@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@"," module github.com/traefik/traefik/v2"," ","-go 1.26.0","+go 1.27.0"," "," require ("," \tgithub.com/BurntSushi/toml v1.6.0","@@ -60,10 +60,12 @@ require ("," \tgithub.com/prometheus/client_model v0.6.2"," \tgithub.com/quic-go/quic-go v0.59.1"," \tgithub.com/rancher/go-rancher-metadata v0.0.0-20200311180630-7f4c936a06ac // No tag on the repo.","+\tgithub.com/samber/slog-logrus/v2 v2.5.4",